<title>EGYPT: Egypt o/night pound rates narrow, one week steady.</title>
<headline>Egypt o/night pound rates narrow, one week steady.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound narrowed slightly to between 10 1/8 and 10 5/16 percent on Tuesday from 10 and 10 5/16 percent on Monday, bankers said.</p>
<p>One said he made an &quot;exceptional trade&quot; at 9 3/4 percent. One week rates were steady at 10 1/8 and 10 5/16, bankers said. State-owned banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1 REUTER CEH MF</p>
